stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> S_AWAKE : reset

    S_AWAKE --> S_ARMING : controller_idle_i begins idle count
    S_ARMING --> S_AWAKE : activity arrives
    S_ARMING --> S_REQ : idle_cnt reaches idle_threshold and enable set
    S_REQ --> S_ASLEEP : pdn_grant_i drives CKE low
    S_REQ --> S_AWAKE : activity arrives
    S_ASLEEP --> S_AWAKE : exit on activity (SR tXSR by scheduler)

    note left of S_AWAKE
      powerdown_ctrl.sv (single-channel).
      OPTIONAL - not in the default top build.
      Config: idle_threshold_i, enable_pde_i,
              enable_sref_i (SR has priority).
      dfi_cke_o low in S_ASLEEP, high elsewhere.
      pdn_kind_o = 0 PDE, 1 SR (latched in S_REQ).
      sref_active_o high in S_ASLEEP when SR.
    end note
